<section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="boundary-page-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">Legal and Spatial Reference</p>
  <h1 id="boundary-page-title">Mukundara Hills Tiger Reserve boundary, ESZ and notifications</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    The tiger reserve, its core and buffer, the Eco-Sensitive Zone and a proposed expansion are
    different legal or planning layers. This page separates them by instrument, date, area and status.
  </p>
