<section class="section" aria-labelledby="reading-rule-heading">
  <div class="notice-panel">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Reading Rule</p>
      <h2 id="reading-rule-heading">A planning map does not change a legal boundary</h2>
      <p>
        A notification issued under the Wild Life (Protection) Act establishes or amends the tiger-reserve
        area. An ESZ notification regulates a separate surrounding zone. A KML file is a spatial aid, while
        a plan or an in-principle approval records intended action. These records must not be treated as interchangeable.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="button-link" href="https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/raj/forest/en/aboutus/departmental-wings/wildlife/details-of-protected-area-/mukundara-hills-tiger-reserve.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official MHTR record</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section landscape-evidence-panel" id="current-legal-area" aria-labelledby="current-area-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Current Legal Baseline</p>
    <h2 id="current-area-heading">The 2023 notification revised MHTR to 1,135.787 sq km</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      Rajasthan Forest Department notification F.3(22)Forest/2023, dated 5 October 2023, amended the
      2013 instrument. It substituted the earlier core and buffer schedules and inserted Bhainsrodgarh-area
      forest and revenue entries in the Critical Tiger Habitat schedule.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="landscape-stat-grid">
    <article class="landscape-stat-card">
      <span class="landscape-stat-value">690.71178 sq km</span>
      <h3>Core / Critical Tiger Habitat</h3>
      <p>69,071.178 hectares in the amended Schedule I(A).</p>
    </article>
    <article class="landscape-stat-card">
      <span class="landscape-stat-value">445.07522 sq km</span>
      <h3>Buffer area</h3>
      <p>44,507.522 hectares in the amended Schedule I(B).</p>
    </article>
    <article class="landscape-stat-card">
      <span class="landscape-stat-value">1,135.787 sq km</span>
      <h3>Total notified tiger reserve</h3>
      <p>The total currently published on the Rajasthan protected-area register.</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <p class="source-note">
    Sources: <a href="https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/dam/raj/forest/ForestDepartment/PDFs/Department%20Wing/Wildlife/Protectedarea/Mukundra%20hills_0001_1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">5 October 2023 notification (official scan)</a>
    and the <a href="https://forest.rajasthan.gov.in/content/raj/forest/en/aboutus/departmental-wings/wildlife/details-of-protected-area-.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">current Rajasthan protected-area register</a>.
  </p>
</section>

