    <h2 id="area-comparison-heading">Why official pages can show different MHTR figures</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      The difference is principally a question of source date and legal layer. Older national profiles
      describe the 2013 reserve; the current Rajasthan register incorporates the 2023 amendment.
    </p>
  </div>

